WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,180 --> 00:00:01,900
By the way, where can I buy quilts?

2
00:00:01,900 --> 00:00:03,580
Quilts are very common.

3
00:00:03,580 --> 00:00:05,380
You can buy it in any supermarket and it seems pretty cheap.

4
00:00:05,380 --> 00:00:06,700
There are dozens and there are more than a hundred

5
00:00:06,700 --> 00:00:07,780
Anyway, quilts are cheaper now

6
00:00:07,780 --> 00:00:08,700
So expensive

7
00:00:08,700 --> 00:00:10,300
You want something cheaper, right?

8
00:00:10,300 --> 00:00:12,020
The cheapest one costs just a few dozen yuan for a quilt.

9
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:13,620
But it’s okay to cover us with the quilt here.

10
00:00:13,620 --> 00:00:15,580
It won’t work if you go to a cold place, it’s still too thin.

11
00:00:15,580 --> 00:00:16,620
What kind of quilt do you want?

12
00:00:16,620 --> 00:00:17,620
It can prevent cold

13
00:00:17,620 --> 00:00:19,500
And it is used in very cold places

14
00:00:19,500 --> 00:00:22,660
That person said that a bed of more than 100 or 200 yuan is not enough for Brother Xiao.

15
00:00:22,660 --> 00:00:24,780
We can collect quilts when we collect garbage.

16
00:00:24,940 --> 00:00:26,480
Now many people want to change their quilts

17
00:00:26,480 --> 00:00:27,580
And that kind of old quilt

18
00:00:27,580 --> 00:00:29,260
Everyone no longer likes to say it’s too serious.

19
00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:31,020
Nowadays everyone likes to use new-style quilts

20
00:00:31,020 --> 00:00:32,020
Send Qing Qing and prepare for the cold

21
00:00:32,020 --> 00:00:33,300
You said you can receive these too

22
00:00:33,300 --> 00:00:34,620
Yes, you can receive it all

23
00:00:34,620 --> 00:00:35,620
Then let's leave quickly

24
00:00:38,410 --> 00:00:39,770
Why is the atmosphere not right?

25
00:00:39,770 --> 00:00:41,610
It costs 300 yuan to move goods in the market for half a day.

26
00:00:41,610 --> 00:00:43,450
Who can do it for three hundred people at noon?

27
00:00:43,450 --> 00:00:44,650
Me me we can do that too

28
00:00:44,650 --> 00:00:45,570
Find me and follow Brother Xiao

29
00:00:45,570 --> 00:00:47,850
Brother Xiao and I are particularly good at moving things for you.

30
00:00:48,730 --> 00:00:51,330
This body can definitely do the job, and you too

31
00:00:51,330 --> 00:00:53,690
Help with moving the goods in the market, boss.

32
00:00:53,690 --> 00:00:54,650
Let's go right now

33
00:00:54,650 --> 00:00:56,130
You add a contact information to an address

34
00:00:56,130 --> 00:00:57,490
We'll ride there by ourselves on a small electric donkey

35
00:00:57,490 --> 00:00:58,490
OK, my surname is Lin

36
00:00:58,490 --> 00:01:03,580
Give me a call, Boss Lin, when you arrive later

37
00:01:03,900 --> 00:01:05,580
These are my products waiting for you to come and move them
